---
description: Prevent new backend architecture debt during ordinary feature work.
---

Follow `skills/coherent/reference/prevention.md` and the template at `skills/coherent/adapters/cursor/prevention.mdc`.

Before adding a service, abstraction, DTO, helper, dependency, boolean, fallback, compatibility path, or layer: search for the existing authoritative concept.

After implementing: search for code the change made obsolete.

If a baseline exists, run `coherent check --changed` (or `coherent check`) and answer whether the feature made the system conceptually harder to change.
